  m_Name: Eirik
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::ResidentDefinition
  id: expedition.eirik
  displayName: Eirik
  description: Soldier from the expedition into the Unquiet Forest. Lost when the waystone connection broke.
  rescueLine: Took you long enough. How many are behind you?
  arrivalLine: Show me the wall. Then show me where it's weakest.
  welcomeLine: 
  fallenLine: Go. I've held worse.
  fightLines:
    spotted:
    - Finally, something I can hit.
    - Stay behind my shield, if you can find it.
    behindYou:
    - Behind you, you fool!
    hurt:
    - Twenty winters, and it still hurts.
    won:
    - Is that all? I was only warming up.
    - Clean your blade. It's a bad habit to forget.
